Done. Here's the summary of changes:

googlesearch.js — complete rewrite:

11 industries with targeted Google Maps queries (3–11 queries each, ~50 total)
Processes industries sequentially, saves each to leads/<industry>_leads.json
Creates leads/ folder automatically if missing
Deduplication per-industry by place_id
whatsapp.js — args updated:

Added --industry=<name> shorthand → auto-resolves to leads/<name>_leads.json
Default now points to leads/clinic_leads.json
--leads= still works for custom file paths
Workflow:


# 1. Scrape all industries (run once)
node googlesearch.js

# 2. Send outreach per industry
node whatsapp.js --industry=dental
node whatsapp.js --industry=realestate
node whatsapp.js --industry=fitness

# 3. Follow-up after 2–3 days
node whatsapp.js --industry=dental --followup



# Check progress across all 11 industries (no WhatsApp login needed)
node whatsapp.js --status

# Auto-pick next industry with pending leads → sends batch of 20
node whatsapp.js

# Specific industry
node whatsapp.js --industry=dental

# Follow-up (Stage 2)
node whatsapp.js --followup
node whatsapp.js --industry=dental --followup

# Reset batch progress
node whatsapp.js --industry=dental --reset   # one industry
node whatsapp.js --reset                     # all industries
The --status table shows each industry's total / eligible / attempted / remaining at a glance without connecting to WhatsApp.


Done. The dashboard is open in your browser. Here's what it has:

Left sidebar — industry navigation with lead counts, click any to filter instantly

Stats row — Total leads · Has website · LinkedIn found · Issues detected · Stage 1 sent · Stage 2 sent

Top bar — search by name/type/address, filter by status / website / LinkedIn / issues, clear button, CSV export

Table — sortable columns (click any header), shows rating, phone, website link, LinkedIn badge, issue count, contact status badge

Click any row to expand and see:

LinkedIn founder profiles with name, title, direct profile link
Website issues list from the analyzer
Business address
Rebuild any time after running more outreach or scraping:


node build-dashboard.js